<Item XName="Note1" UserName="Note1" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt; &#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Phased Array TX 2D&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoBodyText style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoBodyText style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoBodyText style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;************************************************&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face=Calibri&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Simulation Task&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;************************************************&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;BR&gt;This example shows how to generate array antenna pattern.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;************************************************&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face=Calibri&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face=Calibri&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Workspace Description&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;************************************************&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;For the RADAR_PhasedArrayTx / RADAR_PhasedArrayRx model, the spacing of elements can either&amp;nbsp;be uniform or non-uniform. The value of the spacing will be multiples of wavelength when the spacing is uniform,&amp;nbsp;otherwise the spacing values can be set arbitrarily&amp;nbsp;by using an array&amp;nbsp;where the unit is meter. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The parameter mask_array provide the capability to enable or disable the elements in order to simulate the arbitrary linear array or 2-D planar array. The size of mask_array should be the same as the maximum element number of the array. If the&amp;nbsp;value in the mask_array is set to 1,&amp;nbsp;it means the element at the corresponding position is enabled. Otherwise the elements at the corresponding position&amp;nbsp;are disabled or not installed.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The final 2-D antenna pattern is plotted using Dynamic3D model or MATLAB Script equations.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;To scan the antenna pattern, the theta range is [0:180] and the phi range is [0:360], same as the setting of EMPro antenna&amp;nbsp;pattern file or HFSS antenna&amp;nbsp;pattern file or CST antenna&amp;nbsp;pattern file.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;1. One Element&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In this design, one CST antenna pattern file is read to draw its pattern.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;2. Horizontal Linear Array&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In this design, 16 antenna elements are placed on horizontal orientation. And&amp;nbsp;RADAR_Tx_DBS_2D model is used to set the beam radiation direction as [30,0].&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;3. Vertical Linear Array&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In this design, 16 antenna elements are placed on&amp;nbsp;vertical orientation. And&amp;nbsp;RADAR_Tx_DBS_2D model is used to set the beam radiation direction as [30,90].&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;4. Planar Array&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In this design, 16*16 antenna elements are placed on planar. And&amp;nbsp;RADAR_Tx_DBS_2D model is used to set the beam radiation direction as [30,60].&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;</Text>
